      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Workaround: Instead of a float, I only use a bool parameter to toggle between two animations, which sets \"Gravity Falloff\" to 0 or 1. The animations has 3 keyframes. The first keyframe sets the \"Gravity Falloff\" parameter on the Phys Bone component. The second keyframe disables the Phys Bone component and the third keyframe enables the Phys Bone component again.",
