  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-24T17:23:18.920Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I wanted to be able to change the gravity on my hairs, depending on a radial puppet menu and a float (0-1).\nChanging the values manually in Unity during play time works. But it doesn't work with an animation. I can see, that the animation updates the values on the component depending on my paramater, but nothing happens. When the Phys Bone component will be disabled and enabled manually, the changes will be visible.\nI would expect, that all parameters can be changed by animation during runtime.",
